# Kopia safety

## Read-only default

List snapshots, policies, and repo status are fine when Kopia work is
authorized. Do **not**:

- create a snapshot against a path the user did not name
- restore (overwrite live files)
- `forget` / delete snapshots or wipe a repository
- run maintenance that expires data beyond a named policy

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object/path.

## Restore risk

Before restore: state destination path impact and that restore can overwrite
live files. Prefer inventory evidence (snapshot exists) first. Never paste
repository passwords or key material into chat.
